# SDK Targets.
#
# The extended set (java, csharp, swift, zig) is deliberately NOT built for
# this demo. incident.io's response envelopes fail the generated entity smoke
# tests in every one of those targets — csharp 37/362, swift 11/239,
# zig 35/134 — while the six below are clean. Shipping a demo whose tests do
# not pass would undo the point of the demo. Recorded as a toolchain gap in
# the prospect working file; revisit once it is fixed upstream.


@"ts.aontu"
@"js.aontu"
@"py.aontu"
@"php.aontu"
@"lua.aontu"
@"go-mcp.aontu"
@"go.aontu"
